Added a new property called 'platform\&.gpu_fabric_guid' to 'nvidia-smi --query-gpu'
.IP "\(bu" 2
Updated 'nvidia-smi nvlink -gLowPwrInfo' command to display the Power Threshold Range and Units
.PP
